53. **SSH/tunnel commands use the Tailscale hostname `oracle-research`, not the public Oracle IP.** Default template: `ssh -L <port>:localhost:<port> -N ubuntu@oracle-research -i ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_oracle`. The `-i` flag and `ubuntu@` prefix stay — Tailscale SSH is not enabled on this VM, so sshd still requires the authorized key. → [feedback_ssh_use_tailscale.md](projects/-home-ubuntu/memory/feedback_ssh_use_tailscale.md)
54. **Keep CLAUDE.md lean; factor extended how-tos into `~/.claude/rules/<topic>.md`.** CLAUDE.md is always loaded, so every line costs context per turn. New tool/workflow guidance goes in a separate rules file, with only a short pointer (≤3 lines) in CLAUDE.md. Matches the existing pattern for writing style, reasoning transparency, and marimo. → [feedback_keep_claudemd_lean.md](projects/-home-ubuntu/memory/feedback_keep_claudemd_lean.md)

